        "id": 1000277
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-06T16:22:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In Skia autoroll configuration you need to tell it a single dependency that it would monitor and create rolls to update.\nYou\u0027d need to have `https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src.git` in the roller config, and then Skia will search for it in the DEPS file (it doesn\u0027t use gclient, it parses the DEPS file directly).\nThen, Skia autoroll will need to run this script to update the rest of the dependencies.",
      "parentUuid": "a061e1c2_3e1c5c30",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 69,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 69,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "14f11d7169943e092a3a48660c05c854cb96e191",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
