      "message": "Sounds good, ANGLE also has special handling for this here https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/angle/scripts/roll_chromium_deps.py;l\u003d529;drc\u003d4dcd4d2fc6024a01337bb173198d14a6783ba252.\nThis is for the case when the script fails to be run by the autoroller and needs to be run from a local checkout. This happens when Chromium renames a dependency, and the script fails to find it for syncing.\nWhen the script is run by the autoroller, autoroller updates chromium_revision and creates a CL that this script will modify to update the rest.",
