      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Is the plan for this roller to replace all the skia rollers we have now?\n\nIn general, yes. If there\u0027s a reason that a separate roller should still exist (which sounds to be the case for `vulkan-headers`), then there shouldn\u0027t be any issues with continuing to use a separate roller. Doing so should just require removing the relevant entry from this script.\n\nRegarding `vulkan-headers`, is it just `vulkan-headers` that should have its own roller or everything that\u0027s currently handled by the `vulkan-deps-dawn-autoroll` roller?",
      "parentUuid": "a72f76f0_1b4ea3cb",
