      "writtenOn": "2025-11-06T18:53:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, but is the intention to continue using separate rollers for all of those? At least for ANGLE, you mentioned in the doc that \"This has a dedicated roller at the moment https://autoroll.skia.org/r/angle-dawn-autoroll. I think it\u0027s actually good if Dawn syncs Chromium\u0027s revision. Now we have a circular dependency problem, because of which we have to manually roll Dawn into ANGLE. If both Dawn and ANGLE sync Chromium\u0027s version of each other, it should be a good solution for the circular dependency.\"",
      "parentUuid": "8e44777d_25045a17",
      "revId": "14f11d7169943e092a3a48660c05c854cb96e191",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
